OL,3,GNEWSAHow man's Halloween house display
OL,4,Ahas become bittersweet tradition
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs people up and down the country look
OL,7,Fforward to celebrating Halloween this
OL,8,Fevening, one Greater Manchester man
OL,9,Ftakes the festivities further than
OL,10,Fmost.
OL,12,FDave Barron, 61, from Bramhall, in
OL,13,FGreater Manchester, has been decorating
OL,14,Fhis home for Halloween every year since
OL,15,F2011, and has been preparing this
OL,16,Fyear's Back to the Future-themed
OL,17,Fdisplay since May.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,408,400,260,160,0,100
