OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F407A1793442341
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAHow man's Halloween house display
OL,4,Ahas become bittersweet tradition
OL,5,
OL,6,FDave's efforts are all a tribute to his
OL,7,Flate wife, Catherine. Accepting
OL,8,Fdonations from Halloween visitors, he
OL,9,Fhas raised more than #55,000 for the
OL,10,FMacmillan cancer charity, which cared
OL,11,Ffor Catherine before she died in 2020.
OL,13,F"Halloween is emotional for me," Dave
OL,14,Fsaid. "I miss Catherine tremendously.
OL,15,FShe'd think I'm an absolute lunatic,
OL,16,Fbut she was always a big part of it and
OL,17,FI think she'd be really proud."
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
